  "純看統測加權分數分發，無須校系甄試。": "Placement based purely on TCTE weighted scores, no department examination required.",
  "四技日間部聯合登記分發 — 純採統測加權分數分發，不需面試 / 書審 / 作品集的入學管道。 適用對象：參加四技二專統一入學測驗（統測）的考生 樹德動遊系一次開 3 個招生代碼。學生填寫志願序，由系統依統測分數高低統一分發 — 是進入動遊系的「最後機會」。": "Four-Year College Day Division Joint Centralized Placement (四技日間部聯合登記分發) — Placement based purely on weighted TCTE scores, requiring no interview / documentary review / portfolio.\n\nTarget Audience: Candidates taking the Joint Technological and Vocational College Entrance Examination (TCTE / 統測)\n\nShu-Te AGD offers 3 admission codes at once. Students fill in preference rankings, and the system places candidates centrally by TCTE scores — the 'last chance' to enter AGD.",
  "國 2 · 英 1 · 數 1 · 專一 3 · 專二 3": "Chinese 2 · English 1 · Math 1 · Specialized I 3 · Specialized II 3 (國 2 · 英 1 · 數 1 · 專一 3 · 專二 3)",
  "📊 純統測加權分數 — 不需面試 / 書審 / 作品集": "📊 Purely based on TCTE weighted scores — No interview / documentary review / portfolio required",
  "💰 達標可同步爭取設計學院菁英獎學金（10-43 萬）": "💰 Qualifying scores can simultaneously contend for College of Design Elite Scholarship (NT$ 100,000-430,000 / 10-43 萬)",
  "🎯 設計群 07064（3 名 + 原住民 1 名）為動遊系主力": "🎯 Design Group 07064 (3 general places + 1 Indigenous place) is the main AGD pathway",
  "⏱ 是進入動遊系的「最後機會」— 8/06 放榜後即開學": "⏱ The 'last chance' to enter AGD — School starts shortly after the 8/06 results announcement",
  "🎯 純看統測加權分數 — 不需面試 / 書審 / 作品集": "🎯 Purely based on TCTE weighted scores — No interview / documentary review / portfolio required",
  "💰 達標可同步爭取設計學院菁英獎學金（10-43 萬）— 第一志願填樹德動遊系即自動入列": "💰 Qualifying scores can simultaneously contend for College of Design Elite Scholarship (NT$ 100,000-430,000 / 10-43 萬) — Automatically considered by listing Shu-Te AGD as 1st preference",
  "📊 設計群加權：(專 1 + 專 2) × 3 + 國 × 2 + 英 + 數，達 420 入列獎學金": "📊 Design Group weighting: (Specialized 1 + Specialized 2) × 3 + Chinese × 2 + English + Math; reaching 420 qualifies for scholarship",
  "🚪 名額較少（設計 3 名）— 建議搭配甄選入學雙軌進行，提高錄取機會": "🚪 Fewer places (3 Design places) — Recommended to pursue dual tracks alongside Recommendation and Selection Admission to improve admission chances",
