  "獨立招生｜採書審 + 面試": "Individual Admissions | Documentary review + interview",
  "包含二技 / 四技 / 二專進修部與產學攜手。目前頁面未列出動遊系名額 — 請洽樹德進修部專區。": "Includes two-year college / four-year college / two-year junior college continuing education and industry-academia collaboration programs. Currently no AGD quotas listed on this page — please consult the Shu-Te Continuing Education Division portal.",
  "進修部相關招生 — 涵蓋二技 / 四技 / 二專進修部與產學攜手計畫，採書審 + 面試（免統測 / 學測）的彈性入學管道。 適用對象：在職人士、想兼顧工作與學業者、二度就讀者 上課時間：典型週一至五晚上 18:30-21:30 + 部分假日課程。 ※ 各管道是否開放動遊系名額，請以樹德招生網對應專區公告為準。": "Continuing Education Division Admissions (進修部相關招生) — Encompassing two-year college / four-year college / two-year junior college continuing education and industry-academia collaboration programs, a flexible admission pathway using documentary review + interview (exempt from TCTE / GSAT).\n\nTarget Audience: Working professionals, those seeking to balance work and studies, second-degree seekers\n\nClass Hours: Typically Monday to Friday evenings 18:30-21:30 + selected weekend courses.\n\n* Please refer to announcements on the Shu-Te Admissions website to confirm whether AGD quotas are open for each pathway.",
  "📌 目前頁面未列出動遊系名額 — 請定期關注樹德招生網": "📌 Currently no AGD quotas listed on this page — Please monitor the Shu-Te Admissions website regularly",
  "📞 動遊系系辦：6102（07-6158000）可諮詢進修部開放狀況": "📞 AGD Office: 6102 (07-6158000) for inquiries on Continuing Education Division offerings",
  "🌙 進修部上課多為週一至五 18:30-21:30": "🌙 Continuing education classes are mostly Monday to Friday 18:30-21:30",
  "🎓 進修部畢業證書與日四技完全相同": "🎓 The diploma awarded by the Continuing Education Division is completely identical to the Four-Year Day College diploma",
  "🌙 上課時間：週一至五 18:30-21:30 + 部分假日課程": "🌙 Class hours: Monday to Friday 18:30-21:30 + selected weekend courses",
  "🏢 與日四技共用實驗室、教師、業界資源": "🏢 Shares laboratories, faculty, and industry resources with the Four-Year Day College",
  "💼 適合：在職動畫師、遊戲業界從業者進修升學、二度就讀者": "💼 Suitable for: Working animators, gaming industry professionals seeking advanced degrees, second-degree seekers",
  "💰 學雜費較日四技略低，可申請助學貸款 + 工讀補助": "💰 Tuition and fees are slightly lower than Four-Year Day College; eligible for student loans + work-study subsidies",
