  "樹德 · 進修學制（夜四技）": "Shu-Te · Continuing Education Programs (Night Four-Year College / 夜四技)",
  "樹德 · 二技進修部單獨招生": "Shu-Te · Two-Year Continuing College Independent Admissions (二技進修部單獨招生)",
