  "115 學年度起": "AY 115 onward",
  "10 萬 ~ 43 萬": "NT$100,000–430,000",
  "統測 4/25-4/26｜聯分 7/28-7/31｜放榜 8/06": "TCTE 4/25-4/26 | Joint Placement 7/28-7/31 | Results 8/06",
  "依設計群／商管群統測加權後總分自動入列；聯分第一志願填樹德動遊系即啟動。": "Automatically considered based on weighted TCTE total scores in Design / Business & Management Groups; activated by selecting Shu-Te AGD as 1st preference in Joint Distribution.",
  "樹德設計學院菁英、群英招募獎助學金 — 不是入學管道，是入學後的高額獎助方案。 申請資格： ● 當年度參加四技二專統一入學測驗，成績達設置標準（加權後總分） ● 聯合登記分發第一志願選填樹德科技大學設計學院指定科系 設計群門檻：國文 + 英文 + 數學 +（專 1 + 專 2）×2 達 420 分以上 商管群門檻：國文 + 英文 + 數學 +（專 1 + 專 2）×2 達 400 分以上 不需另行申請 — 統測達標 + 聯分第一志願填本系即自動入列。入學後依在校成績維持資格分學期／學年核發；部分高額方案需於就學期間維持指定學業成績與專業表現。": "Shu-Te College of Design Elite and Talented Recruitment Scholarships — Not an admission pathway, but a high-value scholarship program after admission.\n\nEligibility:\n● Participated in the Joint Technological and Vocational College Entrance Examination (TCTE) in the current academic year, with scores reaching established standards (weighted total score)\n● Listed designated departments of Shu-Te University College of Design as 1st preference in Joint Distribution Admission\n\nDesign Group Threshold: Chinese + English + Math + (Specialized 1 + Specialized 2) × 2 reaching 420 points or above\nBusiness & Management Group Threshold: Chinese + English + Math + (Specialized 1 + Specialized 2) × 2 reaching 400 points or above\n\nNo separate application required — Automatically qualified upon meeting TCTE threshold and listing AGD as 1st preference in Joint Distribution. Disbursed by semester/year after enrollment subject to maintaining academic performance; certain high-value tiers require maintaining designated academic grades and professional performance during study.",
  "💎 高額方案（30-43 萬）需在學期間維持指定學業成績 + 專業表現": "💎 High-value tiers (NT$ 300,000-430,000 / 30-43 萬) require maintaining designated academic grades + professional performance during study",
  "🎓 部分方案可直接抵免學雜費 — 4 年學費全免有可能": "🎓 Certain tiers can directly offset tuition and fees — 4-year full tuition waiver is possible",
  "📋 達標自動入列 — 不需另寫申請、不需面試、不需作品集": "📋 Automatically qualified upon reaching score threshold — No separate application, no interview, no portfolio required",
  "🎯 鎖定設計群 / 商管群 — 動遊系屬設計群，門檻 420 分起": "🎯 Targeted at Design Group / Business & Management Group — AGD belongs to Design Group, threshold starts at 420 points",
  "🏆 樹德設計學院獨家方案 — 不與其他校外獎學金衝突": "🏆 Exclusive program of Shu-Te College of Design — Does not conflict with external scholarships",
