  "一、開課名稱：「Unity Certified User (UCU) 國際認證」 二、上課日期：115/5/16(六)、115/5/17(日) 三、證照考試：115/5/17(日) 四、上課地點：D0625 教室 五、招生名額：20 人，額滿為止，可依序排列候補；報名學生需配合全程參與，不得缺課，並同意參加證照考試。 六、報名時間：即日起，至額滿為止。 七、考試科目：Artist (此為 Unity 第一張證照) 主辦單位：動畫與遊戲設計系 協辦單位：研究發展處職涯發展暨校友服務中心 負責老師：楊智彰老師，分機 6112，Email: chzzyang@stu.edu.tw": "1. Course Name: \"Unity Certification User (UCU) International Certification\"\n2. Class Dates: 115/5/16 (Sat), 115/5/17 (Sun)\n3. Certification Exam: 115/5/17 (Sun)\n4. Class Location: Classroom D0625\n5. Enrollment Quota: 20 people, until full, waitlist available in order; enrolled students must participate fully, no absences allowed, and agree to take the certification exam.\n6. Registration Period: From now until full.\n7. Exam Subject: Artist (This is the 1st Unity certification)\n\nOrganizer: Department of Animation and Game Design\nCo-organizer: Career Development and Alumni Service Center, Office of Research and Development\nResponsible Instructor: Yang Zhi-zhang (楊智彰), ext. 6112, Email: chzzyang@stu.edu.tw",
