  "學海築夢已邁入第 9 屆 · 3 國 / 8 公司戰略合作": "Xuehai Dream Project Entering 9th Cohort · Strategic Collaboration with 8 Companies Across 6 Countries",
  "與日本（含沖繩）、韓國、印尼 3 國共 8 家公司合作。每年透過教育部「學海築夢」計畫派遣優秀學生赴 Hautecouture 株式會社（日本愛媛縣松山市）實習，2023 年復辦後累計 22 位學生赴日完成業界專案。": "We partner with 8 companies across 3 countries: Japan (including Okinawa), South Korea and Indonesia. Through the Ministry of Education’s overseas internship program (學海築夢), outstanding students intern each year at Hautecouture Inc. in Matsuyama, Ehime, Japan. Since the program resumed in 2023, 22 students have completed industry projects in Japan.",
