  "學海築夢與 Hautecouture 株式會社的合作已邁入第 9 屆。海外實習配合學校國際交流獎助學金 + 教育部補助，學生實際支出大幅降低。": "The collaboration between Xuehai Dream Project and hautecouture Inc. has entered its 9th cohort (some older documents mention Year 5 / Year 8; updated based on 2026 data). Combined with the university's international exchange scholarships and Ministry of Education subsidies, students' actual expenses for overseas internships are substantially reduced. (學海築夢與 Hautecouture 株式會社的合作已邁入第 9 屆 - 部分舊文件提到第 5 年 / 第 8 年，依 2026 年度資料更新)",
