  "動遊系畢業門檻含「專業證照」要求，109-113 學年度學生累積取得 811 張證照，涵蓋 Adobe / Autodesk / Unity 國際原廠認證、TQC+ 視傳設計、ITE 資訊專業人員、iPAS 經濟部產業人才能力鑑定等四大體系。系上每年開辦 4 場左右證照輔導班，由本系教師親自指導。": "Graduation requirements for the Department of Animation and Game Design include 'Professional Certifications.' Across AY 109-113, students accumulated 811 certifications across four major systems: Adobe / Autodesk / Unity international original vendor certifications, TQC+ Visual Communication Design, ITE Information Technology Expert, and iPAS Industry Professional Assessment System by the Ministry of Economic Affairs. The department organizes approximately 4 certification coaching classes each year, instructed directly by departmental faculty.",
