  "由涂承恩、李冠霖、張淑盈、唐莉蓉共同創作，陳美蓉老師指導的 2D 動畫短片《失竊的祕方》。 故事以「誤解與和解」為主題，描繪一位老廚師因祕方書失竊而誤會新餐廳老闆。透過角色造型與視覺敘事對比，引發觀眾對「以貌取人」的反思，並融合 SDGs 性別平等、減少不平等及和平正義等核心理念。": "Co-created by Tu Cheng-en (涂承恩), Li Guan-lin (李冠霖), Zhang Shu-ying (張淑盈), and Tang Li-rong (唐莉蓉), and advised by Professor Chen Mei-rong (陳美蓉), the 2D animated short film The Stolen Recipe (《失竊的祕方》).\n\nThe story takes 'misunderstanding and reconciliation' as its theme, depicting an old chef who misunderstands a new restaurant owner due to the theft of a secret recipe book. Through character design and visual narrative contrast, it prompts audiences to reflect on judging people by appearances, while integrating core SDG values of Gender Equality, Reduced Inequalities, and Peace, Justice and Strong Institutions.",
  "《癒光之音：悅曲》": "Soothing Sounds: The Enchanting Music (《癒光之音：悅曲》)",
  "教育部入圍": "Ministry of Education Finalist",
  "教育部 2026 年全國技專校院學生實務專題製作競賽暨成果展 入圍": "Ministry of Education 2026 National Practical Project Competition and Exhibition for Technical College and University Students: Finalist (教育部 2026 年全國技專校院學生實務專題製作競賽暨成果展 入圍)",
  "「於此，奏響名為希望的樂曲」（Soothing Sounds: The Enchanting Music）。融合奇幻角色設計、細膩光影演出與東方神祕意象的遊戲作品。 入圍教育部 2026 年全國技專校院學生實務專題製作競賽暨成果展。": "“Here, play a melody called hope” (Soothing Sounds: The Enchanting Music). A game combining fantasy character design, delicate lighting and shadow, and mysterious Eastern imagery.\n\nShortlisted for the Ministry of Education’s 2026 National Practical Project Competition and Exhibition for Technical College and University Students.",
  "巴哈姆特 ACG 創作大賽 · 優選雙獎": "Bahamut ACG Creation Contest · Double Excellence Awards (巴哈姆特 ACG 創作大賽 · 優選雙獎)",
  "優選 × 2": "Excellence Award × 2",
  "原創動畫": "Original Animation",
  "《人造人》博浩原、戎軒頤、陳政民、李育賢；《癡迷的現實》宋秋陽、陳志揚、藤川黎星": "Android (《人造人》): Bo Hao-yuan (博浩原), Rong Xuan-yi (戎軒頤), Chen Zheng-min (陳政民), Li Yu-xian (李育賢); Obsessive Reality (《癡迷的現實》): Song Qiu-yang (宋秋陽), Chen Zhi-yang (陳志揚), Teng-chuan Li-xing (藤川黎星)",
  "巴哈姆特 ACG 創作大賽 · 優選賞 ×2（從全台 69 件入圍作品中脫穎而出）": "Bahamut ACG Creation Contest · Excellence Award × 2 (stood out among 69 shortlisted entries across Taiwan) (巴哈姆特 ACG 創作大賽 · 優選賞)",
  "《人造人》— 呼應 SDG 16「和平、正義及健全制度」": "Android (《人造人》) — Echoing SDG 16: Peace, Justice and Strong Institutions",
  "《癡迷的現實》— 1980 懷舊風 · 融入 SDG 4 與 SDG 12": "Obsessive Reality (《癡迷的現實》) — 1980s nostalgic style, integrating SDG 4 and SDG 12",
  "2025 年度「ACG 創作大賽」由台灣最大 ACG 社群平台──巴哈姆特電玩資訊站舉辦。動遊系兩部原創動畫《人造人》與《癡迷的現實》同時榮獲「優選賞」，在全台 69 件入圍作品中脫穎而出。 《人造人》以人造智慧生命為主題，呼應 SDG 16「和平、正義及健全制度」。 《癡迷的現實》以 1980 年代懷舊美術風格呈現偶像崇拜與理性認知的衝突，融入 SDG 4「優質教育」與 SDG 12「負責任消費與生產」。": "The 2025 ACG Creation Contest was organized by Taiwan's largest ACG community platform, Gamer / Bahamut (巴哈姆特電玩資訊站). Two original animated works from the AGD Department, Android (《人造人》) and Obsessive Reality (《癡迷的現實》), simultaneously won the Excellence Award, standing out among 69 shortlisted works across Taiwan.\n\nAndroid (《人造人》) takes artificial intelligent life as its theme, echoing SDG 16: Peace, Justice and Strong Institutions.\nObsessive Reality (《癡迷的現實》) presents the conflict between idol worship and rational cognition in a 1980s nostalgic art style, incorporating SDG 4: Quality Education and SDG 12: Responsible Consumption and Production.",
  "時報金犢獎國際競賽 · 第二名": "International Times Young Creative Awards · 2nd Place (時報金犢獎國際競賽 · 第二名)",
  "第二名 + 18 組入圍": "2nd Place + 18 Finalist Groups",
  "廣告動畫": "Advertising Animation",
  "裴欣慧、黃若庭、王巧安、蔡思淇": "Pei Xin-hui (裴欣慧), Huang Ruo-ting (黃若庭), Wang Qiao-an (王巧安), Cai Si-qi (蔡思淇)",
  "第 34 屆時報金犢獎國際競賽 · 永慶房屋招募廣告類 第二名": "The 34th International Times Young Creative Awards · Yung-Ching Realty Recruitment Advertising Category: 2nd Place (第 34 屆時報金犢獎國際競賽 · 永慶房屋招募廣告類 第二名)",
  "從全球上萬件參賽作品中脫穎而出": "Stood out among tens of thousands of entries worldwide",
  "本系整體入圍 18 組（張純雅 11 組 + 陳美蓉 7 組）": "The department received 18 finalist nominations in total (Zhang Chun-ya (張純雅) 11 groups + Chen Mei-rong (陳美蓉) 7 groups)",
  "第 34 屆時報金犢獎國際競賽 — 永慶房屋雇主品牌招募廣告系列篇（柴犬篇、浣熊篇、松鼠篇）榮獲「永慶房屋招募廣告類」第二名，從全球上萬件參賽作品中脫穎而出。 運用動物角色設定，將「不綁約」、「不爆肝」、「不扣薪」三大招募訴求轉化為輕鬆幽默的視覺語言。": "In the 34th International Times Young Creative Awards (第 34 屆時報金犢獎國際競賽), the Yung-Ching Realty Employer Brand Recruitment Advertising Campaign Series (Shiba Inu Edition, Raccoon Edition, Squirrel Edition) won 2nd Place in the 'Yung-Ching Realty Recruitment Advertising Category', standing out among tens of thousands of entries worldwide.\n\nUsing animal character designs, it translated three major recruitment appeals—'no binding contract', 'no burnout overtime', and 'no wage withholding'—into a lighthearted and humorous visual language.",
