  "全台指標性數位內容競賽「2025 放視大賞」共 8 件畢業製作入圍。 動畫類 5 部：《失竊的祕方》、《人造人》、《癡迷的現實》、《妖夢》、《神癒》 遊戲類 3 部：《糖霧之謎》、《眼及之處》、《Trace》": "A total of 8 graduation capstone projects were selected as finalists in Taiwan's benchmark digital content competition, 2025 Vision Get Wild (2025 放視大賞).\n\nAnimation Category (5 works): The Stolen Recipe (《失竊的秘方》), Android (《人造人》), Obsessive Reality (《癡迷的現實》), Phantom Dream (《妖夢》), Divine Healing (《神癒》)\nGame Category (3 works): Mystery of Sugar Mist (《糖霧之謎》), As Far as the Eye Can See (《眼及之處》), Trace",
  "蘇中和教授 · 全球前 2% 頂尖科學家": "Professor Su Zhong-he (蘇中和) · World's Top 2% Scientists",
  "連四年榮登": "Listed for 4 Consecutive Years (連四年榮登)",
