  "蘇中和教授（動遊系）": "Professor Su Zhong-he (蘇中和) (AGD Department)",
  "連續四年入選《全球前 2% 頂尖科學家》（World's Top 2% Scientists）": "Selected for four consecutive years in the World's Top 2% Scientists (《全球前 2% 頂尖科學家》)",
  "代表性論文單篇引用次數已超過數千次": "Representative individual papers cited more than thousands of times",
  "在教育研究領域名列全球前 2% 頂尖水準": "Ranked within the world's top 2% in the field of education research",
  "蘇中和教授（副校長暨設計學院院長）連續四年入選《全球前 2% 頂尖科學家》（World's Top 2% Scientists），代表性論文單篇引用次數已超過數千次，在教育研究領域名列全球前 2% 頂尖水準。 研究範疇涵蓋設計教育、遊戲化 STEM 教育、數位雙生與擴增實境設計，並成功跨足智慧設計與 AI 影像處理。": "Professor Su Zhong-he (蘇中和) (Vice President and Dean of the College of Design) has been selected for four consecutive years in the World's Top 2% Scientists (《全球前 2% 頂尖科學家》), with single representative papers cited thousands of times, ranking among the world's top 2% in the field of education research.\n\nHis research scope encompasses design education, gamified STEM education, digital twins, and augmented reality design, while successfully expanding into intelligent design and AI image processing.",
